 <div class="info-section">
 <h3><i class="fas fa-pen-nib" style="color:var(--green);margin-right:.5rem"></i> Comment Guidelines</h3>
 <ul class="bullet-list" style="margin-bottom:1rem">
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Write in your own voice — no AI-sounding or generic comments</li>
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Be personal and genuine — share your real opinion or experience</li>
 <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Well-structured comments earn extra XP from admin</li>
 <li><i class="fas fa-times-circle" style="color:var(--red)"></i> Don't write a wall of text — quality beats quantity</li>
